      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "殘米壹萬九千八百八十五石六斗貳升壹合壹勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "残米　一万九千八百八十五石六斗二升一合一勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Residual rice: 19,885.6211 koku. The figure is the arithmetic remainder of the previous book page: page 97 prints 正租 米貳萬百貳拾四石貳斗八升四合四勺 (20,124.2844) less 内 米貳百三十八石六斗六升三合三勺 (238.6633), and 20,124.2844 − 238.6633 = 19,885.6211 exactly. (MASTER parses this same raw string as 19885.62211 — a spurious fifth decimal; the printed sub-units are only 六斗貳升壹合壹勺 = .6211.)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "殘米"
      }
    ],
