        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "三百戸　藩卒"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "三百戸　藩卒"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Domain sotsu, the lower-rank retainer stratum: 300 households. MASTER records 5 for this field; the scan plainly reads 三百戸, and the household sum only closes on 12,251 with 300 here — MASTER's 5 belongs to the adjacent 倍卒 column. The next book page (99) gives this group 男六百七十九人・女六百七十六人 = 1,355 persons, which is exactly analytic_wide's sotsu_persons for Kitsuki and implies 4.5 persons per household across 300 households; 1,355 persons in 5 households would be impossible."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "藩卒"
      }
    ],
